that will drastically
speed up your progress,

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.860
and lots of other resources.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.960
If you wanna take a look,
there's a link to the academy

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.610
in the description below the video

